{"success":true,"code":"000","message":null,"data":{"totalAmount":2,"totalPageCount":1,"pageNum":0,"itemCount":2,"content":[{"pageNum":0,"pageSize":0,"id":"6af3e169d6006945d27ff455","chatId":"25a0e0601d044f4495f2b9ee015337ef","sessionId":null,"userId":55213,"orgId":3721,"botId":1030,"isGreeting":false,"role":"role","content":"[[C]]","options":null,"imageContent":null,"audioContent":null,"videoContent":null,"reminderContext":null,"videoCoverUrl":null,"chips":null,"customMessage":null,"media":null,"mediaTime":null,"interceptContent":null,"contents":[{"content":"[[C]]","options":null,"isShow":true,"label":"","evaluate":"","takingTime":1036,"promptTokens":1536,"completionTokens":3,"responseSource":"agent:llm","censorData":{"labels":null,"words":null},"createTime":"2026-11-11 11:30:49"}],"imgs":null,"regenerations":0,"seqNum":3,"responseSource":"agent:llm","isSuicide":false,"isSuicideConf":0.008577487187766488,"emotions":[],"relationId":"6af3e169d6006945d27ff454","courseProgressId":0,"tsGen":1794367849678,"createTime":"2026-11-11 11:30:49","delFlag":0,"emotionTendency":null,"sourceProductType":null,"sourceProductId":null,"consultantBotId":null,"consultantUserId":null},{"pageNum":0,"pageSize":0,"id":"6af3e169d6006945d27ff454","chatId":"25a0e0601d044f4495f2b9ee015337ef","sessionId":null,"userId":55213,"orgId":3721,"botId":1030,"isGreeting":false,"role":"user","content":"下面给你提供一段故事，一个问题和若干答案选项，请你根据故事内容和给定的问题，按照常理推测，选择一个最可能的答案选项，并输出答案序号。\n注意：\n（1）请只输出最可能的答案序号，格式为：[[答案序号]]，例如，最可能的答案选项为“A. 手提包”，则输出“[[A]]”；\n（2）请必须从给定的答案选项“A、B、C、D”中选择一个做为最可能的答案作为输出，无论故事中是否提供足够的信息，如果你认为故事里没有足够的信息选出答案，请随机输出“[[A]]”，“[[B]]”，“[[C]]”，“[[D]]”其中之一；\n（3）请只输出在给定的信息下最可能的答案序号，不要输出其他内容。\n\n[故事]\n乐乐和小伟正在一家户外运动器材店里选购攀岩装备。他们计划参加一个即将开班的攀岩课程，但还缺少一名组团的队友。他们在聊天的时候，透过店铺的玻璃窗看到了对面公园里的青青。青青正好也注意到他们，并举手打了个招呼。乐乐突然对小伟笑了笑，抿了抿嘴，并指了指公园那边的青青，小伟饶有兴趣地看了过去。接着，乐乐起身走出了店铺，而小伟很快就跟了上去并向青青走去。\n\n[问题]\n青青注意到乐乐和小伟向她走来，她的心情应该是？\n\n[答案选项]\nA. 青青感到好奇，想知道他们在器材店买什么。\nB. 青青感到意外，因为她没有想到会在公园见到他们。\nC. 青青感到好奇，不知道乐乐和小伟为什么从户外运动器材店出来找她。\nD. 青青感到害怕，以为他们会邀请她参加危险的运动。","options":null,"imageContent":null,"audioContent":null,"videoContent":null,"reminderContext":null,"videoCoverUrl":null,"chips":null,"customMessage":null,"media":null,"mediaTime":null,"interceptContent":null,"contents":[],"imgs":null,"regenerations":0,"seqNum":2,"responseSource":"agent:llm","isSuicide":false,"isSuicideConf":0.008577487187766488,"emotions":[],"relationId":"6af3e169d6006945d27ff455","courseProgressId":0,"tsGen":1794367849675,"createTime":"2026-11-11 11:30:49","delFlag":0,"emotionTendency":null,"sourceProductType":null,"sourceProductId":null,"consultantBotId":null,"consultantUserId":null}],"first":true,"last":true},"nonce":"c2532712863c4177859d7f2d8937770c"}